// TLS ClientHello fingerprints. Given a caller-built JA3 string (decimal
// TLSVersion,Ciphers,Extensions,EllipticCurves,ECPointFormats), NET_JA3_HASH
// writes the 32-char lowercase MD5 hex into %buf. NET_JA4_HASH12 writes the
